-- Restructure MeasurementResult from the payloadJson/summaryJson blob shape into
-- fully typed columns, and add the optional master-level CalibrationTestPoint
-- child of DeviceCalibrationParameter. Design: MeasurementResult_Stage1_Design_
-- Finalization.md §3. MeasurementResult has 0 rows and no runtime, so the
-- DROP COLUMN / ADD COLUMN NOT NULL columns need no backfill.
--
-- Two blocks below are HAND-EDITED, not generated by `prisma migrate diff`:
--   1. The natural-key unique index carries `NULLS NOT DISTINCT` (PostgreSQL 16;
--      confirmed 16.15 on local + VPS) so a NULL calibrationTestPointId
--      (Pattern A / note-only parameters) still collides on a duplicate tuple.
--      Prisma's @@unique syntax cannot express this. First use of NULLS NOT
--      DISTINCT in this repo.
--   2. CHECK constraints (replicateIndex >= 1, attemptNumber >= 1,
--      CalibrationTestPoint.sequence >= 1) — Prisma cannot model CHECK
--      constraints; raw SQL, same pattern as
--      DeviceCalibrationParameter_decimalPlaces_range / CalibrationRequestItem_qty_positive.

